.git
.gitignore
# Exclude dotenv files at every depth, including the public template.
**/.env
**/.env.*
private
**/target
README.md
LICENSE

# Local editor JDK and optional Eclipse workspace
.jdk
.metadata

# Eclipse / m2e / Spring Tools at the root and in current/future modules
**/.project
**/.classpath
**/.settings
**/.factorypath
**/.apt_generated
**/.apt_generated_tests
**/.externalToolBuilders
**/.sts4-cache
**/.springBeans

